     "body": "<p>I just reproduce this bug using the fcr:import rest api<br/>\nThe Header Location return the input URL.  <br/>\ne.g. curl -i -X POST --data-binary \"@child1.xml\" \"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/node2/fcr:import?format=jcr/xml\"<br/>\nthe Header Location is <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/node2\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/node2</a></p>\n\n<p>Should the correct Header Location be <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/node2/child1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/node2/child1</a> and is what this ticket about? </p>",
